      "description": "I'm looking at the MRR All Plans card on the Subscription Billing page with no filters applied, and it is showing a value of 600. I would like to understand the technical calculation behind this figure \u2014 specifically, which subscription records are included, how recurring revenue is aggregated across all plans, and whether there are any exclusions (e.g., cancelled, paused, or trial subscriptions). This is not a question about business policy, but about the underlying data logic and formula used to arrive at that number.",
